error[E0481]: a queued callback can't take `Ref<T[]>`: C reads the array back before the callback runs
  --> tests/programs/c/callbacks/e0481.la:3:30
  |
3 | extern fun each_block(f: fun(Ref<i64[]>, data), user: data);
  |                              ^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: mark the callback `inline` (`cb: fun(Ref<i64[]>, data) inline`), so it runs during C's call and its changes reach C

For more about E0481, run `lughac explain E0481`.
